 height="10" rx="2"></rect></svg><h3 class="text-foreground mb-2 mt-4 font-medium">An agent that finishes the job</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-balance">Every agent gets its own workspace with full internet access. It researches, builds, and fixes things end to end, then brings you finished work to approve.</p></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-end"><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-card ring-border-illustration shadow-black/6.5 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-lg ring-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span><span class="text-sm font-medium">Agent workspace</span></div><div class="mt-4 space-y-4"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><div class="ring-border-illustration flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[10px] font-medium shadow ring-1">1</div><div class="flex-1 space-y-2 pt-1"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Runs SEO audit</div><div class="bg-illustration ring-border-illustration mt-1 rounded-md p-2 font-mono text-[10px] shadow shadow-black/5 ring-1"><span class="text-muted-foreground">$ </span><span class="text-foreground">npx lighthouse /blog</span></div><div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x size-3 text-red-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">Sitemap missing from index</span></div></div></div><div class="border-border absolute -bottom-2.5 left-2.5 top-8 border-l border-dashed"></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check size-5 shrink-0 fill-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div class="flex-1 space-y-2 pt-0.5"><div class="text-xs font-medium">Adds SEO helper</div><div class="dark:bg-emerald-500/5 mt-1 rounded-md p-2 font-mono text-[10px] shadow shadow-black/5 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/40"><span class="text-muted-foreground">$ </span><span class="text-foreground">npm install @astrojs/sitemap</span></div><div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-1"><span class="text-xs text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Search metadata updated</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island> </div> </div> </section> <section class="l2-container l2-section-top"> <header class="relative flex w-full flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-x-8 gap-y-6"> <div class="max-w-xl text-left max-md:pr-16"> <div> <h2 class="text-balance text-[2rem]/9 font-semibold tracking-normal text-[#0f1115] lg:text-[2.5rem]/[2.75rem]"> Publish from the company context you already have  </h2> </div> <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-base/6 text-zinc-500 lg:text-lg/7"> Bring launch notes, product docs, customer learnings, founder drafts, and positioning into one workspace. Paragraph turns them into owned media your team can approve and ship. </p> </div> <div class="shrink-0"> <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 justify-start" data-analytics-location="infrastructure"> 
