  <div data-founder-greeting data-analytics-location="founder-greeting" class="pointer-events-none fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-50 flex flex-col items-end gap-3 sm:bottom-6 sm:right-6" data-astro-cid-g7w3dhvr> <div data-founder-card class="stagger-fade pointer-events-auto max-w-[17rem] rounded-2xl border border-black/[0.07] bg-white p-4 shadow-[0_18px_50px_-16px_rgba(26,22,19,0.28)]" style="--stagger-fade-delay: 1400ms" data-astro-cid-g7w3dhvr> <button type="button" data-founder-dismiss aria-label="Dismiss" class="absolute right-2 top-2 flex size-6 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-md text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.04] hover:text-[#0f1115]" data-astro-cid-g7w3dhvr> <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-g7w3dhvr> <path d="M18 6 6 18" data-astro-cid-g7w3dhvr></path> <path d="m6 6 12 12" data-astro-cid-g7w3dhvr></path> </svg> </button> <p class="m-0 pr-5 text-sm leading-[1.5] text-[#0f1115]" data-astro-cid-g7w3dhvr>
Hey! I'm Colin, the founder of Paragraph. I'd love to show you around.
